    "detailed_description": "<br>         <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deddb92a0491ed8f4c4762a2ed3373a5.poster.avif?t=1715081318\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deddb92a0491ed8f4c4762a2ed3373a5.webm?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deddb92a0491ed8f4c4762a2ed3373a5.mp4?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Real-time action combat:</strong> Feel the heat of fast-paced top-down combat that involves a mix of tactical positioning, use of powerful abilities, quick reflexes, and coordinated team play to outsmart opponents. Your strategy, your victory.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Player vs Player:</strong> Put your team to the ultimate test by engaging in exciting battles against other players whether you're facing off in the open world or in dedicated battle arenas.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deca69d7f0a5a7bc74f9cd7b5a285546.poster.avif?t=1715081318\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deca69d7f0a5a7bc74f9cd7b5a285546.webm?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deca69d7f0a5a7bc74f9cd7b5a285546.mp4?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Creatures:</strong> Capture a wide variety of Spherix, each defined by their own element, role and abilities. Assemble a team of up to 4 Spherix, discover ideal synergies for your individual playstyle and find the perfect team setup for any challenge. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Grow &amp; Fuse:</strong> Battle, level up, evolve, and fuse your Spherix to unlock new abilities and perks, expanding your range of build options.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Enhance &amp; equip:</strong> Empower your Spherix by equipping items that boost their attributes. These Items can also be enhanced to unleash their full potential.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/6bb3356114195f8e8a50869ffca0dc65.poster.avif?t=1715081318\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/6bb3356114195f8e8a50869ffca0dc65.webm?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/6bb3356114195f8e8a50869ffca0dc65.mp4?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Open world:</strong> Explore the world of Trinia where you can complete quests, events, collect resources and solve puzzles.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Multiplayer online:</strong> Change the course of your journey with other players where cooperation, competition, and community shape your experience.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dungeons:</strong> Unveil the echos of the past and experience handcrafted and randomly generated dungeons that feature unique events, enemies, bosses and loot.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Key features</strong></h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <strong>Ranked PvP:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">   <li> Seasons<br></li><li> Solo and premade queue <br></li><li> Special rewards</li></ul> </li><li> <strong>Endless dungeon mode:</strong> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Endgame challenge <br></li><li> Scaling difficulty and rewards </li></ul> </li><li> <strong>Economy:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Player driven<br></li><li> Marketplace </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Planned Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Improved evolving and dynamic open world.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Spherix riding.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Character Personalization.</strong></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br>         <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deddb92a0491ed8f4c4762a2ed3373a5.poster.avif?t=1715081318\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deddb92a0491ed8f4c4762a2ed3373a5.webm?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deddb92a0491ed8f4c4762a2ed3373a5.mp4?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Real-time action combat:</strong> Feel the heat of fast-paced top-down combat that involves a mix of tactical positioning, use of powerful abilities, quick reflexes, and coordinated team play to outsmart opponents. Your strategy, your victory.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Player vs Player:</strong> Put your team to the ultimate test by engaging in exciting battles against other players whether you're facing off in the open world or in dedicated battle arenas.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deca69d7f0a5a7bc74f9cd7b5a285546.poster.avif?t=1715081318\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deca69d7f0a5a7bc74f9cd7b5a285546.webm?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/deca69d7f0a5a7bc74f9cd7b5a285546.mp4?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Creatures:</strong> Capture a wide variety of Spherix, each defined by their own element, role and abilities. Assemble a team of up to 4 Spherix, discover ideal synergies for your individual playstyle and find the perfect team setup for any challenge. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Grow &amp; Fuse:</strong> Battle, level up, evolve, and fuse your Spherix to unlock new abilities and perks, expanding your range of build options.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Enhance &amp; equip:</strong> Empower your Spherix by equipping items that boost their attributes. These Items can also be enhanced to unleash their full potential.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/6bb3356114195f8e8a50869ffca0dc65.poster.avif?t=1715081318\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/6bb3356114195f8e8a50869ffca0dc65.webm?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657670/extras/6bb3356114195f8e8a50869ffca0dc65.mp4?t=1715081318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Open world:</strong> Explore the world of Trinia where you can complete quests, events, collect resources and solve puzzles.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Multiplayer online:</strong> Change the course of your journey with other players where cooperation, competition, and community shape your experience.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dungeons:</strong> Unveil the echos of the past and experience handcrafted and randomly generated dungeons that feature unique events, enemies, bosses and loot.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Key features</strong></h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <strong>Ranked PvP:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">   <li> Seasons<br></li><li> Solo and premade queue <br></li><li> Special rewards</li></ul> </li><li> <strong>Endless dungeon mode:</strong> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Endgame challenge <br></li><li> Scaling difficulty and rewards </li></ul> </li><li> <strong>Economy:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Player driven<br></li><li> Marketplace </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Planned Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Improved evolving and dynamic open world.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Spherix riding.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Character Personalization.</strong></li></ul></li></ul>",
